OL,3,GNEWSATackling the 'war on drugs': Could
OL,4,Atesting at gigs work?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBars, chip vans and portaloos are all
OL,7,Fcommon sights at classic outdoor gigs
OL,8,Fin Northern Ireland.
OL,10,FBut in the rest of the UK and the
OL,11,FRepublic of Ireland, some also have
OL,12,Fdedicated facilities that allow for the
OL,13,Frapid testing and identification of
OL,14,Fharmful drugs and substances.
OL,16,FPolice this week warned about the
OL,17,F"serious, potentially life-changing,
OL,18,Frisks of taking or supplying illegal
OL,19,Fdrugs" at outdoor music events.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
